#! btw 1
#! name: silent-crossfader
#! license: CC0-1.0
#! visibility: public
# Listening-test fixture: the crossfader all the way to A shuts deck B (BeatScript Android 0.3.40 started its
# Player there; deck B's bass and pads played to nobody and nothing said so). listen must flag deck B.
# expect: silent deck=B reason=crossfader
# expect: heard deck=A
tempo 124
crossfader 0
deck A: kick x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ | snare ~ ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ | hihat ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~ vel=60..90
deck B: bass a2 ~ ~ a2 ~ ~ a2 ~ ~ ~ c3 ~ e2 ~ ~ ~ inst=sub-bass | harmony chord(am) inst=warm-pad
end at bar 8
